    <rdfs:label>Address Urbanization Name</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>An urbanization denotes an area, sector, or residential development within a geographic area. Commonly used in Puerto Rican urban areas, it is an important part of the addressing format, as it describes the location of a specific street whose name may occur multiple times within the same ZIP Code. NIEM 6.0 nc:AddressUrbanizationName.</rdfs:comment>
